    "detailed_description": "<strong>Enjoy the simplicity of jumping as your primary mechanic and levels designed for continuous flow.</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Master the art of wall jumping and sliding.<br></li><li>Takes about 15 to 45 minutes to beat depending on your pace and skill level.<br></li><li>Over 60 levels.<br></li><li>Collect stars for a bigger challenge.<br></li><li>Challenge yourself and others with speedruns (It's a short game so you will have to perfect your every move).</li></ul><br><strong>[Heads up, Celeste players!]</strong><br>Jumplife is inspired by Celeste but It's easier than Celeste.<br>If you have beated Celeste, you might find this game relaxing instead challenging.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2914000/extras/63f06327dcd0a8ca5520e95a2712a088.poster.avif?t=1725983500\" width=600 height=363 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2914000/extras/63f06327dcd0a8ca5520e95a2712a088.webm?t=1725983500\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>",
